{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>And you shall remember all the commandments of YHWH.</b> For the numerical value (גִּימַטְרִיָּא) of צִיצִית is six hundred, and eight threads and five knots — here are תרי\"ג (Tanḥuma)." "<b>And you shall not stray after your hearts.</b> Like ״מִתּוּר הָאָרֶץ״ (Numbers 13); the heart and the eyes are the spies of the body — they procure the transgressions for it: the eye sees, the heart desires, and the body commits the transgression (Tanḥuma)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:08.170861852Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}